WEBVTT

00:05:58.361 --> 00:06:01.151
Nisam znao što ove
jedinice i nule znače.

00:06:01.151 --> 00:06:03.218
Nakon 15 sati,

00:06:03.218 --> 00:06:05.820
počeo sam shvaćati
što je to,

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.592
ali javljala mi se sumnja

00:06:07.592 --> 00:06:09.181
da ono u što gledam

00:06:09.181 --> 00:06:12.104
nije povezano s onim
što sam tražio.

00:06:12.104 --> 00:06:14.591
Nakon 20 sati,
dijelovi su se počeli slagati

00:06:14.591 --> 00:06:18.135
vrlo sporo — (Smijeh) —

00:06:18.135 --> 00:06:19.621
i bio sam 
poprilično siguran

00:06:19.621 --> 00:06:21.560
da idem krivim putem,

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.811
ali nisam htio odustati.

00:06:23.811 --> 00:06:26.645
Nakon 30 sati u laboratoriju,

00:06:26.645 --> 00:06:28.906
shvatio sam u potpunosti
u što gledam

00:06:28.906 --> 00:06:31.724
i bio sam u pravu, 
to nije bilo ono što sam tražio.